    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Echo of Prypiat&quot;</strong> is an exciting walking simulator that immerses the player in the atmosphere of the Chernobyl exclusion zone, conveying all the <i>horrors</i> and <i>fears</i> of people left in this forgotten land. The game is created to allow the player to feel the soul of this mysterious place.<br><br>Explore the forbidden zones of Chernobyl, facing dangers and mysteries.<br>Go through trials that will test your endurance and determination.<br>Be prepared to encounter the unknown lurking in the dark corners of the zone.<br>The immersive atmosphere of Chernobyl is achieved through sound effects and visual effects. Realistic recreation of the exclusion zone using advanced graphics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971430/extras/767673a3e86fa7603df5e51e03d64438.poster.avif?t=1745390912\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971430/extras/767673a3e86fa7603df5e51e03d64438.webm?t=1745390912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971430/extras/767673a3e86fa7603df5e51e03d64438.mp4?t=1745390912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
